## Visual

Same palette, same type. Terminals are dense, so tighten but do not change the
system.

- Ground `#050A06`, panels `#0E1410`, borders `#18201A`
- Panel padding drops to 16–20px from the 24–32px used elsewhere
- Body text 13–14px, numbers tabular and right-aligned in every table
- Serif for the token name and headline figures only. Everything else sans.
  Mono for addresses, hashes and raw amounts.
- Green for the accent and for buys. For sells use a muted red that reads as
  information, not alarm — no bright #FF0000.
- No gradients, no glow, no pulsing. A live feed is proven by rows arriving,
  not by something blinking.

