## Data

Nothing new. Everything already has a source:
- Price, backing, supply, treasury, creator, withdrawal state — on-chain
- Holders, top traders — Blockscout
- OHLCV, trades, volume — GeckoTerminal

If a figure in this spec has no source, tell me. Do not invent one and do not
compute something that looks precise from data that can't support it.

